@title 3D view: Build order steps from the plate to the wires
@area 3D
# Toolbar > Build order (also View > 3D > Build order). A strip at the bottom shows the step; Next and Previous add or take away one kind of part, and what a step adds is shown in blue.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text front view
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
click_text "Build order"
wait 30
shot step-0-start
expect "Start (0 of 17)"
check_layout
click_text "Next"
wait 12
shot step-1-first-rail
expect "Step 1 of 17"
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
shot step-3
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
shot step-8
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
shot step-16
check_layout
click_text "Next"
wait 12
wait 20
shot step-17-wires
expect "Step 17 of 17"
check_layout
click_text "Show all"
wait 30
shot shown-all
expect_not "Step 17 of 17"
